COMMENT ON COLUMN procedures.target IS 'Thing or population on which the procedure acts; maps to pko:hasProcedureTarget.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN procedures.is_template IS 'TRUE when the procedure is a reusable template; maps to pko:isTemplate.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN procedures.current_version_key IS 'Current version identifier, mirrored structurally by ProcedureVersions.IsCurrent.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN procedures.semantic_type_iri IS 'Exact PKO class IRI.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN procedures.template_procedure IS 'Template this procedure instantiates (pko:hasTemplate).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN procedures.required_by_regulation IS 'Regulation that makes this procedure mandatory.';

