COMMENT ON COLUMN message_templates.last_valid_approval IS 'The TemplateApprovals id of the approval this template is currently sendable under. Deliberately a raw identifier, not a relationship: TemplateApprovals already points at MessageTemplates, so declaring an FK back would make the two tables mutually dependent and the rulebook is required to stay acyclic. The value is still resolved by INDEX/MATCH in LastApprovedBodyHash.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN message_templates.semantic_type_iri IS 'Resource class IRI.';

