COMMENT ON COLUMN send_intents.proposed_opt_out_position IS 'Character position of the required opt-out phrase within ProposedBody; 0 when absent. Written by the pipeline at render time.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN send_intents.approver_was_notified IS 'Whether the approving human was informed that this intent was refused.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN send_intents.alternate_channel_intent IS 'The follow-up intent raised on a different channel after this one was refused. Stored as a raw identifier rather than an FK: SendIntents pointing at SendIntents would make the table self-referential in a way the DAG contract does not allow here.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN send_intents.refusal_recorded_at IS 'When this refusal was written to a durable record. Empty when no record was ever emitted.';
