COMMENT ON COLUMN app_role_profiles.role_kind IS 'human or software. Drives the login-card silhouette and the icon plate shape.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app_role_profiles.accent_color IS 'Hex accent colour. Distinctive per role; used for chrome, the left-nav active state, and the icon plate.';
