COMMENT ON COLUMN step_cues.escalate_to_role IS 'Role the cue is escalated to.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN step_cues.semantic_type_iri IS 'Semantic type IRI.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN step_cues.operator_question IS 'How a technician on the floor would ask about this warning sign. The assistant offers it verbatim.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN step_cues.signals_failure_mode IS 'The failure mode this warning sign is evidence of. Its recorded response is the assistant''s answer.';

