COMMENT ON COLUMN external_standard_terms.alignment_updated_at IS 'When our mappings and documentation for the term were last updated.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN external_standard_terms.model_still_needs_term IS 'TRUE when the model still needs the concept.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN external_standard_terms.rehomed_as_term IS 'Local concept the term was taken into.';
