COMMENT ON COLUMN sourcing_functions.is_strategically_vital IS 'TRUE when the organization cannot deliver its strategy without the function.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN sourcing_functions.delivers_own_product IS 'TRUE when the function is part of delivering the organization''s own products.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN sourcing_functions.executing_organization IS 'The organization that actually performs the work.';
