COMMENT ON COLUMN practitioner_expertise.procedure IS 'The procedure the expertise is exercised in.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN practitioner_expertise.step IS 'The step the expertise is exercised at.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN practitioner_expertise.elicitation_session IS 'The session in which the expertise was probed.';
