-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- ObservedActions: Actions an observer saw during shadowing or observation, typed as small choices, unofficial workarounds, steps omitted from the practitioner's own account, or documented steps, with the reason given when the observer asked.
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
