COMMENT ON COLUMN observed_actions.action_kind IS 'SmallChoice, Workaround, OmittedObviousStep or DocumentedStep.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN observed_actions.mentioned_in_own_account IS 'TRUE when the practitioner''s own interview account included the action.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN observed_actions.stated_reason IS 'The reason the practitioner gave when the observer asked; blank when nobody asked.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN observed_actions.counterfactual_condition IS 'The different condition the observer asked about.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN observed_actions.counterfactual_answer IS 'What the practitioner said they would do under that condition.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN observed_actions.captured_as_fragment IS 'The knowledge fragment the action was captured as.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN observed_actions.semantic_type_iri IS 'Semantic type IRI.';

-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- ElicitationParticipants: Who took part in an elicitation session: their part in the session, whether they produce or consume the knowledge, their stake in the process, and whether people in their position are normally invited.
