COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_traces.step IS 'The activity definition traced, when the target is a step.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_traces.requirement IS 'The constraint traced, when the target is a requirement.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_traces.source_material IS 'The collected material the knowledge traces to.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_traces.trace_role IS 'Origin (knowledge was taken from it), Validates, Extends, or Contradicts.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_traces.traced_aspect IS 'What the source is cited for: Sequence, StepDescription, Workaround, ActualExecution or Constraint.';
