COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_traces.derivation_route IS 'How the knowledge was produced from the source.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_traces.derived_by_agent IS 'Who (or what) derived the knowledge from the source.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_traces.validated_by_agent IS 'Who confirmed the derived knowledge.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_traces.validated_at IS 'When it was confirmed.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_traces.source_stated_duration_minutes IS 'Duration the source states for the traced step, when it states one.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_traces.contradicted_document IS 'For a contradiction: the document whose prescription practice departs from.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_traces.semantic_type_iri IS 'Semantic type IRI.';

-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- MinedFlowEdges: One step-to-step hand-off reconstructed from a system event log by a process-mining run: how many cases took it, how long cases waited before the next step, and whether it is kept as observed behavior or recorded as intended logic.
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
